1. NXP S32DS Auto-Generated RTD / S32CT Configuration & Project Template Files
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NXP Real-Time Drivers (RTD/) and S32 Configuration Tools auto-generated files
(generate/, board/) are excluded from this repository (.gitignore) and are
automatically populated from the user's local NXP S32 Design Studio installation
when running "Update Code" on s32k144w_touch_cvd.mex.

NXP FreeMASTER Lite mock API script (freemaster/touch_bridge_api.js) is also
excluded from version control and automatically copied from the local NXP
FreeMASTER Lite installation when running run_freemaster.bat.

Any remaining S32DS project startup and linker files (Project_Settings/) are
governed by the NXP Software License Agreement (LA_OPT_NXP_Software_License)
bundled with NXP S32 Design Studio and S32K1xx RTD.
